Type 'help' for commands

A:\> Available commands:
  help - Show this help
  cls - Clear screen
  echo [text] - Display text
  exit - Quit OS
  time - Show system time
  mem - Show memory info
  ver - Show version
  pause - Wait for key press
  color [num] - Change text color (0-7)

With a disk image (vm -b FILE):
  format - Create an empty file system
  dir - List files
  type [file] - Show a file
  write [file] [text] - Replace a file with a line of text
  append [file] [text] - Add a line of text to a file
  del [file] - Delete a file

